#ASSERT `the First Schedule row for` "HFC-134a" EQUALS JUST (`First Schedule row` OF "6(f)", "CH2FCF3", 1300, `a hydrofluorocarbon`)
#ASSERT `the First Schedule row for` "Sulphur hexafluoride" EQUALS JUST (`First Schedule row` OF "5", "SF6", 23500, `another listed gas`)
#ASSERT `the First Schedule row for` "Perfluorobuta-1,3-diene" EQUALS JUST (`First Schedule row` OF "7(q)", "CF2=CFCF=CF2", 1, `a perfluorocarbon`)
#ASSERT `the First Schedule row for` "3,3,4,4,5,5,6,6,7,7,8,8,9,9,10,10,10-Heptadecafluorodec-1-ene" EQUALS JUST (`First Schedule row` OF "6(zm)", "C8F17CH=CH2", 1, `a hydrofluorocarbon`)
#ASSERT `the First Schedule row for` "Water vapour" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `a greenhouse gas under the Act:` "Ozone"
