#ASSERT     `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 1 `in the combustion of a biomass fuel listed in item 3(d)`)          -- item 3(d)
#ASSERT NOT `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Methane" 1 `used and emitted in purging`)                                           -- item 3 is CO2 only
#ASSERT NOT `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 1 `other`)
#ASSERT     `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "HFC-134a" 1 `in using refrigeration or air-conditioning equipment for non-manufacturing purposes`) -- item 4
#ASSERT NOT `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "HFC-134a" 1 `other`)
#ASSERT     `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "HFC-1234yf" 1 `other`)                                                       -- item 4A
#ASSERT     `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "PFC-14" 1 `in using refrigeration or air-conditioning equipment for non-manufacturing purposes`)   -- item 5
#ASSERT NOT `a non-reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "PFC-14" 1 `other`)
