#ASSERT     `a reckonable GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Methane" 1 `other`)
-- Part 3: excluded
#ASSERT     `an excluded GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 1 `in using a vehicle to transport persons or goods`)
#ASSERT     `an excluded GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Methane" 1 `in carrying out AFOLU activities`)
#ASSERT NOT `an excluded GHG emission:` (`emission of` "Methane" 1 `as a fugitive emission, not flaring or venting`)
-- 1,000 t CO2 + 10 t CH4 (280) + 5 t CO2 in purging (not counted) + 1 t SF6 in switchgear (not counted) = 1,280
#ASSERT `the reckonable tCO2e of` (LIST `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 1000 `other`, `emission of` "Methane" 10 `other`, `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 5 `used and emitted in purging`, `emission of` "Sulphur hexafluoride" 1 `in manufacturing, installing, using or disposing of electrical equipment`) EQUALS 1280
-- s 11(2): the vehicle emission is left out of the report; the purging one is reported
#ASSERT count (`the emissions to report among` (LIST `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 1000 `other`, `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 50 `in using a vehicle to transport persons or goods`, `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 5 `used and emitted in purging`)) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the first emissions threshold` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the second emissions threshold` EQUALS 25000

