§§ `Goal 1 — registration (ss 7, 8)`

-- 30,000 tCO2e in 2024, nothing registered: all three, by 30 June 2025, in force 1 January 2025
#ASSERT `the applications required for the year` 2024 `, reckonable tCO2e` 30000 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (YMD 2025 6 30), JUST (YMD 2025 1 1))
-- 2,500: (a) and (b), not (c)
