-- exactly 2,000 "attains" the threshold; 1,999 does not
#ASSERT (`the applications required for the year` 2025 `, reckonable tCO2e` 2000 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE)'s `to register the facility as a reportable facility`
#ASSERT `the applications required for the year` 2025 `, reckonable tCO2e` 1999 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING)
-- exactly 25,000 attains the second threshold
#ASSERT (`the applications required for the year` 2025 `, reckonable tCO2e` 25000 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE)'s `to register the facility as a taxable facility`
-- s 7(2)(a), (3): already a registered person with a reportable facility: only (c)
#ASSERT `the applications required for the year` 2025 `, reckonable tCO2e` 30000 `, status` (`status` TRUE TRUE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (YMD 2026 6 30), JUST (YMD 2026 1 1))
-- s 7(2)(b): control ceasing before the deadline relieves only (a)
#ASSERT `the applications required for the year` 2025 `, reckonable tCO2e` 30000 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` TRUE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (YMD 2026 6 30), JUST (YMD 2026 1 1))
#ASSERT REFUSED `the applications required for the year` 2023 `, reckonable tCO2e` 30000 `, status` (`status` FALSE FALSE FALSE) `, control ceasing:` FALSE
-- s 8(1)(a)(ii)(C): taxable for X — 30 days after the transfer on 10 May 2025
#ASSERT `the applications Y must make on the transfer` (`transfer on` (YMD 2025 5 10) TRUE TRUE 30000) `, Y already registered:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (YMD 2025 6 9), JUST (YMD 2025 5 10))
-- (B): not taxable for X, previous year at the second threshold — the later of 30 June 2025 and 9 June 2025
#ASSERT `the applications Y must make on the transfer` (`transfer on` (YMD 2025 5 10) TRUE FALSE 30000) `, Y already registered:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, JUST (YMD 2025 6 30), JUST (YMD 2025 5 10))
-- (B) again, transfer on 20 June 2025: 30 days later is 20 July 2025
#ASSERT (`the applications Y must make on the transfer` (`transfer on` (YMD 2025 6 20) TRUE FALSE 30000) `, Y already registered:` FALSE)'s `no later than` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 7 20)
-- (A): previous year under the second threshold — 30 June of the year after the transfer; reportable only
#ASSERT `the applications Y must make on the transfer` (`transfer on` (YMD 2025 5 10) TRUE FALSE 10000) `, Y already registered:` TRUE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, JUST (YMD 2026 6 30), JUST (YMD 2025 5 10))
#ASSERT `the applications Y must make on the transfer` (`transfer on` (YMD 2025 5 10) FALSE FALSE 10000) `, Y already registered:` FALSE EQUALS (`Applications required` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, NOTHING)

