§§ `Goal 3 — the carbon tax (ss 16, 20B-20E)`

-- 2025, 30,000.4 tCO2e: A = 30,001 (rounded up) x $25 = 750,025
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2025 TRUE 30000.4 NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS 750025
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2025 TRUE 24999 NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS 0      -- s 16(2)
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2025 FALSE 30000 NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS 0     -- not a taxable facility
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2026 TRUE 40000 NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS 1800000
-- s 20C: (40,000 - 10,000.5) = 29,999.5, rounded up 30,000, x $45 = 1,350,000
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2026 TRUE 40000 (JUST 10000.5) NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS 1350000
-- s 20E(2)(b)(i): a minimum of $40 per tonne of A: 40 x 40,000 = 1,600,000
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2026 TRUE 40000 (JUST 10000.5) (JUST 40) NOTHING) EQUALS 1600000
-- s 20B: Division 1A prescribed to end with 2025, so no allowance for 2026
#ASSERT `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2026 TRUE 40000 (JUST 10000.5) NOTHING (JUST 2025)) EQUALS 1800000
#ASSERT REFUSED `the carbon tax charged for` (`year` 2023 TRUE 40000 NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING)
#ASSERT     `eligible for allowances, exporting:` TRUE `, determined:` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `eligible for allowances, exporting:` TRUE `, determined:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a modified methodology may be applied, assessed:` TRUE `, being revised:` FALSE
#ASSERT     `a modified methodology may be applied, assessed:` TRUE `, being revised:` TRUE

