§§ `The top-level goal`

-- A prescribed-sector plant, registered (person, reportable, taxable), 2025:
-- 30,000 t CO2 burned (reckonable) and 10 t CH4 fugitive (non-reckonable,
-- item 6(b)): 30,000 tCO2e x $25 = $750,000; 30,000 credits at the 2026 price
-- of $25; assessed under s 21(1) on 1 August 2026, so due 30 September 2026;
-- nothing paid, so on 15 October 2026 the 5% penalty is $37,500.
`a plant in 2025` MEANS `Facility year` WITH
    `emissions year`                         IS 2025
    `site`                                   IS `site` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
    `exempted by order under s 74`           IS FALSE
    `emissions`                              IS LIST `emission of` "Carbon dioxide" 30000 `other`, `emission of` "Methane" 10 `as a fugitive emission, not flaring or venting`
    `status at the start of the year`        IS `status` TRUE TRUE TRUE
    `control will cease before the application is due` IS FALSE
    `controlled for part of the year`        IS TRUE
    `monitoring plan approved`               IS TRUE
    `allowance awarded for the year, in tCO2e` IS NOTHING
    `the award's minimum tax per tonne`      IS NOTHING
    `assessment`                             IS `an assessment under s 21(1)`
    `notice of assessment served on`         IS JUST (YMD 2026 8 1)
    `tax paid by the last day`               IS 0
    `as at`                                  IS YMD 2026 10 15

